#: ../../../reference/contrib/opentelemetry.rst:4
msgid ""
"The OpenTelemetry integration has moved to :mod:`litestar.plugins."
"opentelemetry`. The ``litestar.contrib.opentelemetry`` namespace remains as "
"a deprecation shim and is removed before 3.0.0. See :doc:`/reference/plugins/"
"opentelemetry` for the current API documentation."
